port sysutils/gnome-control-center
type port
target @any
reason "gnome-control-center 47.7 -> 50.3 (GNOME 50); migrated compat -> dops; sound/gvc restored via libpulse; needs system goa 3.54 + blueprint-compiler"

file materialize dragonfly/Makefile -> Makefile
file materialize dragonfly/distinfo -> distinfo
file materialize dragonfly/pkg-plist -> pkg-plist

# base FreeBSD patches obsoleted by 50.3:
#  - color login1->ConsoleKit: now drift-proof REINPLACE in post-patch
#  - panels/meson.build sharing/wwan move: REINPLACE (new 'wellbeing' panel broke the context)
#  - cc-about-page.ui hostname hide: 50.3 auto-hides when hostnamed absent (cc-hostname-entry.c)
file remove files/patch-panels_color_cc-color-calibrate.c on-missing noop
file remove files/patch-panels_meson.build on-missing noop
file remove files/patch-panels_system_about_cc-about-page.ui on-missing noop

# system-details (About) FreeBSD OS detection: drop the get_os_build_id hunk
# (that function was refactored away in 50.3); keep the other 5 __FreeBSD__ hunks
file remove files/patch-panels_system_about_cc-system-details-window.c on-missing noop
file materialize dragonfly/patch-panels_system_about_cc-system-details-window.c -> files/patch-panels_system_about_cc-system-details-window.c
